    "description_en": "Fluffy Bosnian fritters with crisp edges, ajvar, white cheese and fresh vegetables.",
    "name_en": "Bosnian uštipci with ajvar and white cheese",
    "base_en": "Bosnian savory fritters",
    "ingredients_en": "350 g flour, 250 g yogurt, 1 large egg, 10 g baking powder, 5 g salt, 80 ml sparkling water, 700 ml frying oil, 180 g ajvar, 160 g white cheese, 200 g cucumber, 250 g tomatoes",
    "recipe_en": "<p>Whisk the egg with yogurt and sparkling water.</p><p>Add flour, baking powder and salt; mix to a thick, slightly lumpy batter.</p><p>Heat oil to 175°C.</p><p>Drop in tablespoons of batter and fry in small batches for 2–3 minutes, turning once.</p><p>Drain and serve immediately with ajvar, cheese, cucumber and tomatoes.</p>",
    "difficulty_en": "Medium",
