    "ingredients_en": "500 g flour, 400 g yogurt, 1 large egg, 25 g sugar, 8 g baking powder, 5 g salt, 30 g butter, 80 ml water, 700 ml frying oil, 180 g berries",
    "recipe_en": "<p>Combine flour, baking powder, sugar and salt.</p><p>Add the egg, 120 g yogurt, melted butter and a little water; knead a soft dough.</p><p>Rest 20 minutes.</p><p>Roll to 6 mm and cut into diamonds.</p><p>Fry over medium heat until golden and drain.</p><p>Serve warm with the remaining yogurt and berries.</p>",
