    "country": "Белгия",
    "tag": "вафли с круша",
    "description_en": "Crisp-edged, fluffy waffles with warm cinnamon pear, thick yogurt and toasted hazelnuts.",
    "name_en": "Belgian waffles with pear, yogurt and hazelnuts",
    "base_en": "pear waffles",
    "ingredients_en": "220 g wheat flour, 2 tsp baking powder, 2 eggs, 300 ml milk, 60 g butter, 25 g sugar, 1 tsp vanilla, 2 firm pears, 1/2 tsp cinnamon, 160 g thick yogurt, 40 g hazelnuts, 1 tbsp lemon juice, 1/4 tsp salt",
    "recipe_en": "<p>Heat the waffle iron.</p><p>Mix the flour, baking powder, sugar and salt.</p><p>Whisk the eggs with the milk, melted butter and vanilla, then combine with the dry ingredients.</p><p>Slice the pears and cook them with the cinnamon and lemon juice for 5–6 minutes.</p><p>Cook 8 small waffles until golden.</p><p>Serve with the warm pears, yogurt and hazelnuts.</p>",
