    "base_en": "crisp stuffed squares",
    "ingredients_en": "400 g wheat flour, 230 ml water, 50 ml oil, 1 tsp salt, 6 eggs, 250 g leek, 2 medium tomatoes, 3 spring onions, 1 tsp ground cumin, 1/2 tsp black pepper, 1 lemon",
    "recipe_en": "<p>Knead a smooth soft dough from the flour, water, a little oil and salt.</p><p>Rest for 20 minutes and divide into 8 balls.</p><p>Finely chop the leek and tomato and mix with the eggs, spring onion, cumin and pepper.</p><p>Roll each ball almost transparent, place filling in the centre and fold into a tight square.</p><p>Cook in an oiled pan for 3–4 minutes per side.</p><p>Serve with lemon.</p>",
