    "ingredients_en": "400 g masa harina, 520 ml warm water, 1 tsp salt, 300 g cooked black beans, 220 g mild melting cheese, 300 g white cabbage, 1 medium carrot, 1/2 small red onion, 80 ml apple cider vinegar, 1 tsp dried oregano, 20 ml oil",
    "recipe_en": "<p>Mix the cabbage, carrot and onion with vinegar, oregano and salt and rest the curtido for 20 minutes.</p><p>Mash the beans to a thick paste and mix with grated cheese.</p><p>Make a soft dough with masa harina, water and salt.</p><p>Divide into 8 balls, indent, fill with beans and cheese and seal.</p><p>Flatten into thick discs.</p><p>Cook in a lightly oiled pan for 4–5 minutes per side.</p><p>Serve with curtido.</p>",
