    "recipe_en": "<p>Slice the onion and peppers and sauté in the oil for 8 minutes.</p><p>Add the garlic, paprika and chopped tomatoes.</p><p>Cook for 10 minutes until thickened.</p><p>Make four wells, crack in the eggs and cook covered for 4–5 minutes.</p><p>Toast the rye bread.</p><p>Serve the lecsó with toast and black pepper.</p>",
