    "base_en": "cassava with coconut and mango",
    "ingredients_en": "500 g freshly grated cassava, 600 ml coconut milk, 300 ml water, 35 g brown sugar, 1 tsp vanilla, 2 large ripe mangoes, 60 g roasted peanuts, 1 tsp lime zest, 1/4 tsp salt",
    "recipe_en": "<p>Put the cassava, coconut milk, water and salt in a saucepan.</p><p>Cook over low heat for 15–18 minutes, stirring often, until the cassava turns translucent and the porridge thickens.</p><p>Add the sugar, vanilla and lime zest.</p><p>Divide among bowls and serve with diced mango and roughly chopped roasted peanuts.</p>",
